          "published": "Mon, 07 Sep 2026 09:29:53 +0800",
          "summary": "<p>财新网09月07日电: 沪指开盘报3942.51点，涨幅 0.32%。</p><p>深成指报13605.02点，涨幅 0.65%；创业板指报3326.42点，涨幅 1.21%；中小板指报8384.58点，涨幅 0.53%。</p><p>盘面上，电子领涨，通信、农林牧渔、机械设备、电力设备、建筑材料等板块涨幅居前，有色金属领跌，煤炭、纺织服饰、钢铁、房地产、食品饮料等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，美国非农数据大超预期，9月美联储加息看向CPI；8家中央金融企业集中增资，合计规模3600亿元；央行将开展5000亿元买断式逆回购操作；AI短剧大洗牌，报价暴跌，精品赛道人才年薪近百万；七部门表示，探索算力设施800V高压直流供电架构，推动超百千瓦单机柜部署；私募基金募集细化规则，合格投资者认定标准生变。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-09-07</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101000416\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101000416\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">中国建筑<p><span class=\"stock-no\">601668.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">4.09</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+4.09</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">中国建筑集团副总经理陈勇涉嫌严重违纪违法被查</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019184\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019184\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">通灵股份<p><span class=\"stock-no\">301168.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">4.09</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+4.09</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">通灵股份2026年半年报：光伏需求收缩致扣非净利转亏，外销高增与双主业转型构成对冲</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101000355\"><div class=\"row-order\">3</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101000355\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">紫金矿业<p><span class=\"stock-no\">601899.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">3.90</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-down\">0.00</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">紫金矿业更正2026年半年报附注部分相关文字错误；百川盈孚发布国内多地多晶硅开工率｜新能源早参</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003354\"><div class=\"row-order\">4</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003354\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">兴业科技<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002674.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">3.90</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+3.90</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">涉嫌信披违法违规遭证监会立案调查兴业科技股民维权征集正式启动</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019017\"><div class=\"row-order\">5</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101019017\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">同益中<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688722.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">2.01</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+2.01</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">同益中2026年中报管理层讨论解读：扣非净利降5.94%、海外收入占比升至37.01%，与2025年报对比</div></a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"yqzszb-infomation\"><ul><li>今日敏感舆情指数，面向所有A股上市公司，以其前一日9:00至当日9:00的敏感新闻和公告信息为基础，建立模型计算出的0-100的指数，用来表征该上市公司舆情敏感程度的高低。</li><li>本文列举了今日指数最高的5只股票，同时列举了今日指数较昨日的涨跌值，以及时间段内主要的敏感新闻之一。</li><li>获取更多上市公司信息和其他高级服务，请查阅<span><a href=\"http://database.caixin.com\">财新数据通</a></span>。</li><li>本报告基于大数据技术自动计算和生成，不代表财新数据观点。</li></ul></div></div>",
